    "page_intro": {
      "en": "Hattie the hedgehog runs the lost-and-found! When ONE owner owns something, we add an apostrophe and an s — the dog's bone. Read who owns it, then tap the word that shows ONE owner. A Grade 1 grammar game about possessive nouns, aligned to Common Core L.1.1.b.",
      "de": "Kostenlos & interaktiv: Dein Kind übt in der Grundschule das Genitiv-s bei Namen – „Annas Ball“, nicht „Anna's“. Ohne Zeitdruck, ohne Punkte, zum Vorlesen.",
